#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:2
msgid "Widgets and telemetry with CBORChannel"
msgstr "使用 CBORChannel 实现控件与遥测"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:4
msgid ""
"The backends on the previous two pages move raw bytes, and a raw byte "
"channel needs a host program that knows how to decode them. Most of the time"
" what a cam wants to publish is simpler than that: a few named readings, a "
"few named controls, a waveform, a depth map. For that case the "
":mod:`protocol` package ships :class:`protocol.CBORChannel`, a ready-made "
"backend that holds named *fields*, serialises them as CBOR records in the "
"SenML layout, and decodes host writes back into field values. Its payoff is "
"that **OpenMV IDE already understands it**: register a ``CBORChannel`` and "
"the IDE's :doc:`Channels view <../../tools/ide/channels>` renders every "
"field as a live widget -- labels, switches, sliders, graphs, maps -- with no"
" host code at all. The same records are plain CBOR, so a custom host decodes"
" them with any CBOR library when you outgrow the IDE."
msgstr ""
"前两页的后端传输的是原始字节，而原始字节通道需要一个知道如何解码它们的主机程序。大多数时候摄像头想要发布的内容比这简单：几个命名读数、几个命名控件、一段波形、一幅深度图。针对这种情况，:mod:`protocol`"
" 包附带了 :class:`protocol.CBORChannel`，这是一个现成的后端，它保存命名的 *字段*，将它们序列化为 SenML 布局的 "
"CBOR 记录，并将主机的写入解码回字段值。它的好处在于 **OpenMV IDE 已经理解它**：注册一个 ``CBORChannel``，IDE 的"
" :doc:`通道视图 <../../tools/ide/channels>` "
"就会把每个字段渲染为实时控件——标签、开关、滑块、图形、深度图——完全不需要主机代码。同样的记录就是普通的 CBOR，因此当你的需求超出 IDE "
"时，自定义主机可以用任何 CBOR 库解码它们。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:19
msgid ""
"The Channels view showing a thermal camera script's controls channel: FPA "
"and AUX temperature readouts with their unit, Measurement and High Temp "
"toggles, Temp Min and Temp Max sliders, and H-Mirror and V-Flip toggles"
msgstr ""
"通道视图显示热成像摄像头脚本的 controls 通道：带单位的 FPA 和 AUX 温度读数、Measurement 和 High Temp "
"开关、Temp Min 和 Temp Max 滑块，以及 H-Mirror 和 V-Flip 开关"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:19
msgid ".. image:: ../../tools/ide/figures/channels-controls.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../../tools/ide/figures/channels-controls.png"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:23
msgid ""
"The ``controls_channel.py`` example's channel as the IDE renders it: "
"readouts, toggles, and sliders for a FLIR Lepton. Every control writes back "
"to the script."
msgstr ""
"IDE 所渲染的 ``controls_channel.py`` 示例的通道：FLIR Lepton 的读数、开关和滑块。每个控件都会写回脚本。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:28
msgid "Readouts and controls"
msgstr "读数与控件"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:30
msgid ""
"A ``CBORChannel`` is a dictionary of typed fields. ``add`` declares each one"
" with a name, a widget ``type``, and the arguments that type needs; "
"assigning to ``ch[\"name\"]`` updates a field; the ``on_write`` callback "
"receives the host's changes::"
msgstr ""
"``CBORChannel`` 是一个带类型字段的字典。``add`` 用名称、控件 ``type`` 和该类型所需的参数声明每个字段；对 "
"``ch[\"name\"]`` 赋值会更新字段；``on_write`` 回调接收主机的更改::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:69
msgid ""
"Run it in the IDE, switch the pane under the frame buffer to *Channels*, and"
" the widgets appear: a label is a read-only value (with its ``unit`` beside "
"it), ``text`` is a block of static rich text, a ``toggle`` is a switch, "
"``slider`` and ``spinbox`` set a number within ``min`` / ``max`` / ``step`` "
"(the spin box for precise entry), ``radio`` and ``select`` pick one of "
"``options``, ``lineedit`` is a free-text field, and ``pushbutton`` is a "
"momentary action that calls ``on_write`` with :data:`True`. The script reads"
" its controls back with ``ch[\"Threshold\"]`` whenever it likes -- the "
"channel holds the latest value -- and ``on_write`` is the hook for the ones "
"that need an immediate reaction. A ``(min, max, value)`` tuple assigned to a"
" slider or spin box moves its range along with its value, which is how a "
"control tracks a sensor whose limits depend on another setting."
msgstr ""
"在 IDE 中运行它，将帧缓冲区下方的窗格切换到 *通道*，控件就会出现：label 是只读值（旁边带有其 ``unit``），``text`` "
"是静态富文本块，``toggle`` 是开关，``slider`` 和 ``spinbox`` 在 ``min`` / ``max`` / "
"``step`` 范围内设置一个数字（微调框用于精确输入），``radio`` 和 ``select`` 从 ``options`` "
"中选择一项，``lineedit`` 是自由文本字段，``pushbutton`` 是瞬时动作，会以 :data:`True` 调用 "
"``on_write``。脚本可以随时用 ``ch[\"Threshold\"]`` 读回其控件——通道保存着最新的值——而 ``on_write`` "
"则是为需要立即响应的控件准备的钩子。向滑块或微调框赋一个 ``(min, max, value)`` "
"元组会连同其值一起移动其范围，这正是控件跟踪某个极限取决于另一设置的传感器的方式。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:84
msgid ""
"The optional ``on_read(channel)`` callback runs just before the channel is "
"serialised for the host -- the place to sample a sensor into a label so a "
"reading is only taken when someone is looking::"
msgstr ""
"可选的 ``on_read(channel)`` "
"回调会在通道为主机序列化之前运行——这是把传感器采样到标签中的地方，这样只有在有人查看时才会进行读数::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:91
msgid ""
"The ``controls_channel.py`` example under File → Examples → ``12-Protocol`` "
"uses exactly this shape to expose a FLIR Lepton's measurement mode, "
"temperature range, and mirror / flip settings while the camera streams."
msgstr ""
"File → Examples → ``12-Protocol`` 下的 ``controls_channel.py`` "
"示例正是用这种形式在摄像头流式传输的同时公开 FLIR Lepton 的测量模式、温度范围和镜像 / 翻转设置。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:97
msgid "Waveforms"
msgstr "波形"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:99
msgid ""
"A ``waveform`` field carries a block of samples with a sample rate. The "
"samples are the raw bytes of an :mod:`array` in the field's ``typecode`` "
"(unsigned 16-bit by default); for several signals at once -- the three axes "
"of an accelerometer -- interleave them and say how many ``series`` there are"
" and what to call them::"
msgstr ""
"``waveform`` 字段携带一块带采样率的采样数据。采样是以字段 ``typecode``\\ （默认为无符号 16 位）表示的 "
":mod:`array` 的原始字节；若要同时传多个信号——例如加速度计的三个轴——请将它们交错排列，并说明有多少个 ``series`` "
"以及它们的名称::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:135
msgid ""
"The IDE plots each waveform as a scrolling graph with one trace per series, "
"timestamps each chunk so gaps between updates show as gaps, and offers a "
"spectrum view, triggers, markers, and recording to CSV, WAV, NumPy, or Edge "
"Impulse files. Replace the synthetic sine with :class:`audio` samples or an "
"IMU driver's readings and the script is a data-collection tool."
msgstr ""
"IDE 将每条波形绘制为滚动图形，每个序列一条轨迹，并为每个数据块加上时间戳，使更新之间的间隙显示为间隙，同时提供频谱视图、触发、标记，以及录制为 "
"CSV、WAV、NumPy 或 Edge Impulse 文件。把合成的正弦波换成 :class:`audio` 采样或 IMU "
"驱动的读数，这个脚本就是一个数据采集工具。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:143
msgid "Depth maps"
msgstr "深度图"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:145
msgid ""
"A ``depth`` field is a ``width`` x ``height`` grid of 32-bit floats, one "
"distance per cell -- what a time-of-flight sensor produces. ``min`` / "
"``max`` declare the range the host should map to colour; the IDE can also "
"range the colours automatically from the data::"
msgstr ""
"``depth`` 字段是一个 ``width`` x ``height`` 的 32 "
"位浮点数网格，每个单元一个距离——正是飞行时间传感器所产生的数据。``min`` / ``max`` 声明主机应映射为颜色的范围；IDE "
"也可以根据数据自动确定颜色范围::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:172
msgid ""
"The ``sensors_channel.py`` example pairs a depth channel like this with a "
"readings channel and a face detector on the same camera. The "
":meth:`~protocol.ProtocolChannel.send_event` call is optional -- the IDE "
"polls channels on its own -- but it tells an event-driven host that a new "
"frame is ready without it having to ask."
msgstr ""
"``sensors_channel.py`` "
"示例将这样的深度通道与一个读数通道和一个人脸检测器配对运行在同一台摄像头上。:meth:`~protocol.ProtocolChannel.send_event`"
" 调用是可选的——IDE 会自行轮询通道——但它可以告知事件驱动的主机有新帧就绪，而无需主机主动询问。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:180
msgid "Decoding on a custom host"
msgstr "在自定义主机上解码"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/protocol/channels/cbor-channels.rst:182
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The records are standard CBOR: each channel read returns an array of maps "
"keyed by SenML's integer keys (``0`` name, ``1`` unit, ``2`` numeric value, "
"``3`` string value, ``8`` data value, and negative keys for the widget type,"
" options, range, and dimensions). A host that has outgrown the IDE reads the"
" channel with :meth:`~openmv.camera.Camera.channel_read` and decodes it with"
" any CBOR library (``pip install cbor2``); writing a control back is a CBOR "
"array of ``{0: name, 2: value}`` maps sent with "
":meth:`~openmv.camera.Camera.channel_write`. The "
":class:`protocol.CBORChannel` reference lists every key. For most projects, "
"though, the IDE's Channels view is the host, and the only code is the cam-"
"side script above."
msgstr ""
"这些记录是标准的 CBOR：每次通道读取返回一个映射数组，以 SenML 的整数键作为键（``0`` 名称、``1`` 单位、``2`` "
"数值、``3`` 字符串值、``8`` 数据值，以及用于控件类型、选项、范围和尺寸的负数键）。需求超出 IDE 的主机可以用 "
":meth:`~openmv.camera.Camera.channel_read` 读取通道，并用任何 CBOR 库（``pip install "
"cbor2``）解码；将控件写回则是一个由 ``{0: name, 2: value}`` 映射组成的 CBOR 数组，通过 "
":meth:`~openmv.camera.Camera.channel_write` 发送。:class:`protocol.CBORChannel`"
" 参考列出了每一个键。不过对于大多数项目，IDE 的通道视图就是主机，唯一的代码就是上面的摄像头端脚本。"
